<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT LPGA DINAH SHORE.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT LPGA DINAH SHORE.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO MIRAGE, California 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the third round of the $900,000 Nabisco Dinah Shore LPGA golf tournament on Saturday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>205 Kelly Robbins 70 67 68, Betsy King 71 67 67</p>
<p>207 Amy Fruhwirth 69 70 68</p>
<p>208 Kris Tschetter 66 76 66</p>
<p>210 Annika Sorenstam (Sweden) 70 72 68, Dottie Pepper 69 70 71</p>
<p>211 Tina Barrett 70 71 70</p>
<p>212 Hiromi Kobayashi (Japan) 72 69 71, Kathryn Marshall (Scotland) 66 73 73</p>
<p>213 Nancy Lopez 70 74 69, Jane Crafter (Australia) 70 71 72</p>
<p>214 Liselotte Neumann (Sweden) 74 71 69, Nancy Bowen 70 74 70, Karrie Webb (Australia) 69 74 71, Pat Hurst 74 69 71, Lisa Hackney (Britain) 70 72 72, Pat Bradley 69 72 73, Laura Davies (Britain) 70 70 74</p>
<p>Additional regional scores:</p>
<p>215 Trish Johnson (Britain) 70 72 73</p>
<p>217 Anne Marie Palli (France) 74 73 70, Helen Alfredsson (Sweden) 74 74 69</p>
<p>218 Marisa Baena (Colombia) 74 71 73</p>
<p>219 Mayumi Hirase (Japan) 70 77 72</p>
<p>220 Kaori Harada (Japan) 72 75 73, Alison Nicholas (Britain) 72 71 77</p>
<p>224 Ayoko Okamoto (Japan) 73 76 75</p>
<p>225 Aiko Fukushima (Japan) 73 76 76</p>
